{"root":{"data":{"id":"dkzzfqjue1s0","created":1787859889339,"text":"人生"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkzzg3eag9s0","created":1787859917301,"text":"人生的两种活法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkzzkbvyej40","created":1787860249241,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkzzgdlv2g80","created":1787859939527,"text":"反抗世界，一辈子为了反抗，一辈子被反抗而耗费"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkzzkgqclaw0","created":1787860259785,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkzzhcthxuo0","created":1787860016176,"text":"被世界裹挟着走，被顶层设计的圈套，一辈子在圈套中照着流程走完一生，只为权贵一笑，就会给一口蜜而活"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}